{#- The client report, with MathJax removed.

    nbconvert's lab template loads MathJax with $...$ as inline maths, so "$5.02M at $48,000"
    in the executive summary was typeset as an equation. The report carries no mathematics, and
    the MathJax config is hard-coded in base/mathjax.html.j2 (mathjax_url cannot switch it off),
    so the block is emptied here. Every output kind is covered - Markdown, DataFrame HTML, HTML()
    - and the report no longer fetches a script from a CDN when a client opens it.
    Passed by RUN_FINAL.bat; guarded by tests/test_delivfix01_no_mathjax.py. -#}
